blocks.en:
The environment implements the following rules and financial mechanisms:
(1) Game and season rules , which define game procedures and regular-season and playoff schedules;
(2) Salary cap , which restricts payroll allocation and player acquisition;
(3) Luxury tax , which imposes additional costs when payroll exceeds the tax threshold;
(4) Financial condition , which updates cash balances using revenue, operating expenses, and luxury tax, with balances carried forward throughout the seasons.

blocks.zh:
环境实施下列规则和财务机制:
(1) 游戏和赛季规则,界定游戏程序和常规赛季及复赛时间表;
(2) 薪金上限,限制薪金分配和玩家购置;
(3) 奢侈品税,在工资超过税额时规定额外费用;
(4)财务状况 利用收入、业务支出和奢侈税更新现金余额,余额在整个季节结转。

blocks.en:
GMs receive information on players, finances, and league rules and can perform four types of management actions:
(1) Drafting , selecting rookie players;
(2) Signing , signing free players;
(3) Trading , negotiating and revising offers involving players and draft picks with other GMs;
(4) Contract renewal , negotiating salaries with players after each season.

blocks.zh:
全球机制接受关于球员、财务和联赛规则的信息,可以执行四种管理行动:
(1) 起草、挑选新手;
(2) 签名,签名自由玩家;
(3) 与其他全球机制进行交易、谈判和修订有参与者参与的提议和抽取草稿;
(4)续约 在每个赛季结束后与球员谈判工资.

blocks.en:
For each of the four sports, we construct five roster types from real-world player data based on ratings, as shown in Figure 3 , with comparable initial strength but distinct needs for bench depth, support for core players, and offensive or defensive improvement:
(1) Balanced , with relatively even strength across starters and reserves;
(2) Star , centered on one standout star with weaker supporting players;
(3) Twins , led by two core players;
(4) Offense , emphasizing shooting;
(5) Defense , emphasizing defensive ability.

blocks.zh:
如图3所示,我们根据真实世界的选手数据,为这四个运动项目分别构建了5个名册类型,其初始实力可比较,但对长凳深度、核心选手的支持以及进攻性或防御性改进有不同的需要:
(1) 平衡,各起始国和储备国实力相对均匀;
(2) 恒星,以一个站立星为中心,支持球员较弱;
(3) 双胞胎,由两个核心角色领导;
(4) 辩护,强调射击;
(5) 防御,强调防御能力.
